<view class="page">
  <view class="banner">V{{version || '0.4.0'}} 本机演示 · 虚构数据 · 未付款 · 禁止真实下单</view>
  <view class="title">校园快取通</view>
  <view class="subtitle">成龙校区与狮子山校区的代取流程演示</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">选择测试身份</view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">虚构账号</text>
      <picker range="{{accounts}}" range-key="name" value="{{selected}}" bindchange="changeAccount">
        <view class="control">{{accounts.length ? accounts[selected].name : '正在读取测试账号'}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <button class="button" disabled="{{loading || busy || !accounts.length}}" bindtap="enter">进入演示</button>
    <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="notice">测试身份可直接切换，没有真实微信登录。请勿填写真实取件码或学生资料。</view>
</view>
